  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have to select only correct combination hence, the option (iv) is correct.</p><p>For 1s orbital : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#968;</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>,&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>,&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>zr</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>Energy needed to excite an electron&nbsp;: from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.6</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi>eV</mi></math></p><p>Energy needed to excite&nbsp;an electron :&nbsp;from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.6</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;(hence, true)</p>"
